<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
    <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 50px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
        <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #4A90E2; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff;">
                <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px;">New Account Created</h1>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6;">
                <p style="font-size: 18px;">Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
                <p>Your account from a new device or browser.</p>
                <p style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #4A90E2; font-family: monospace;">
                    <strong>Your Username is:</strong> {{username}}<br>
                </p>
                <p>Please note tat you username will be what you are going to use to login in to you dashboard.</p>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <a href="{{actionUrl}}" style="background-color: #4A90E2; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;">Love to reach ou to the Developer</a>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #888888; font-size: 12px;">
                &copy; OFM Tech Insight. | All rights reserved.
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
